WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.959
Welcome to Orbit. Work and money. Our focus is Obligation and necessity.

2
00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:16.667
Use have to for an obligation. Use do not have to when something is not necessary. Use must not for something prohibited.

3
00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:19.796
Omar has to arrive before his shift.

4
00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:22.820
He does not have to wear a uniform.

5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.724
Do you have to work on Sundays?

6
00:00:25.724 --> 00:00:35.122
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
